      "id": 6434,
      "name": "Vyolynce",
      "username": "Vyolynce",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/vyolynce/{size}/2397_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-10-10T14:31:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Played a game last night that featured AA, Unity, Haka, and Tempest vs. Akush'Bhuta in Pike Industries. Not the best environment for A'B due to its paucity of targets&nbsp; (she actually milled both Mutagenic Growths while playing Limbs too), but that's randmoness for you. Besides, it was kind of thematic for a chaotic nature spirit to go all eco-teur on Pike's chemical factory.<br><br>Anyway, at one point we had a Vat Explosion flip up. I thought Unity's bots were gonna be toast – and she had quite a few, since we had the sweeping limb under control – although Stealth Bot was out so we could still save a couple. Then I realized that Bee Bot destroys an environment card when it gets destroyed…<br><br>So A'B took 3, then Bee Bot sucked up the whole explosion.<br><br>Two turns later this happened <span class=\"bbcode-i\">again</span>.<br><br>Yeah, we won that one pretty handily. She never even flipped, although the Environment deck was exhausted on the turn we defeated her.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:23.179Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
