      "raw": "Played a game last night that featured AA, Unity, Haka, and Tempest vs. Akush&#39;Bhuta in Pike Industries. Not the best environment for A&#39;B due to its paucity of targets&nbsp; (she actually milled both Mutagenic Growths while playing Limbs too), but that&#39;s randmoness for you. Besides, it was kind of thematic for a chaotic nature spirit to go all eco-teur on Pike&#39;s chemical factory.<br /><br />Anyway, at one point we had a Vat Explosion flip up. I thought Unity&#39;s bots were gonna be toast -- and she had quite a few, since we had the sweeping limb under control -- although Stealth Bot was out so we could still save a couple. Then I realized that Bee Bot destroys an environment card when it gets destroyed...<br /><br />So A&#39;B took 3, then Bee Bot sucked up the whole explosion.<br /><br />Two turns later this happened [i]again[/i].<br /><br />Yeah, we won that one pretty handily. She never even flipped, although the Environment deck was exhausted on the turn we defeated her.\n",
