      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/bb73d2/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-10-14T08:56:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I played a game earlier today where a Velociraptor appeared and chomped Bee Bot, which blasted Ambuscade, then destroyed the Velociraptor. We decided that meant Ambuscade had been riding the Raptor, which ate the Bee Bot, prompting Bee Bot to explode. Inside the Raptor.</p>",
